**Short answer:** Ben Ramsey wrote most of both directories. Almost everyone else who contributed is gone, so he is the one real loss. Tomasz Wrona is the only other person still working on the code.

I counted surviving lines with `git blame -w -M -C` on the current tree. The `.mailmap` folds Ben's two emails and Tomasz's two identities into one person each. I also ran the busfactor script with `--no-github`, so it shows raw emails. I used it only as a cross-check.

**`src/`, about 3,470 lines**

| Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Ben Ramsey | 2,171 | ~63% |
| Tomasz Wrona | 358 | ~10% |
| Carlos C Soto | 270 | ~8% |
| zf2timo | 223 | ~6% |
| icanhazstring | 199 | ~6% |
| Kévin Gomez | 145 | ~4% |

The remaining ~3% is spread over about a dozen one-off contributors.

**`tests/`, about 3,630 lines**

| Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Ben Ramsey | 1,964 | ~54% |
| icanhazstring | 594 | ~16% |
| Kévin Gomez | 329 | ~9% |
| Carlos C Soto | 204 | ~6% |
